<section class="section has-text-left">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="has-text-weight-bold is-size-1 is-size-3-mobile is-uppercase">Pitch Craft</p>
    <p class="projectdescription is-size-5">
   I love pitches. Short sprints diving deep into a brand making something that has to be good the first time. Battlefield like camaraderie and dependence on the capabilities of your peers. Harnessing of new tools, honed skills and big ideas to beat out competitors and win big.
<br><br>
This is a high-level look at a sliver of that output. Brand identities built in an afternoon, spatial art direction along side the best, and the harnessing of whatever tools it took to win the room. No deep-dive strategy, just the work. All successes. All fast. All fun.    <br>
    <p class="has-text-weight-bold is-size-4">Collaborators:</p>
    <p class="collabnames is-family-secondary has-text-weight-bold is-size-4 is-italic ">Kyle Mahan // Keirstin Fernandez // Kate Roberts <br> Crystal Yang // Riley Meek // Volker Lemmer </p>
  </div>
</section>

